              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1600,
              "content": "The PR section is a tinted pill at the trailing end of the toolbar, just before the right-panel toggle, so it shows whether or not the right panel is open. Open In moves to the centre of the window. As the window narrows the pill gives up room first: the grey detail goes, then the buttons drop their titles and shortcuts (tooltips and accessibility labels stay). The PR number chip and status label always stay. The breadcrumb and Open In never move into the toolbar's overflow menu.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Geist",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
